      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那高雅的甜味，\n温柔地治愈着结束一天后疲惫的身心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cc4a6fc27b9693b4a6db5ea82e34772245441877e8fa30b6813dd28d505649",
